From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:07:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Measure caption similarity with a local edit distance

CaptionConsumer took LevenshteinDistance from Apache commons-text, a
library the Android image's source tree does not carry, for one call. It
now computes the same unit-cost edit distance itself.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../controller/CaptionConsumer.java           | 24 ++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/braille/brailledisplay/src/phone/java/com/google/android/accessibility/braille/brailledisplay/controller/CaptionConsumer.java b/braille/brailledisplay/src/phone/java/com/google/android/accessibility/braille/brailledisplay/controller/CaptionConsumer.java
index c3d0c576e300c7999e7860c895104a4498a9796b..6958cc5d4fc1b8d3b827c77a3984478c96a95e8c 100644
--- a/braille/brailledisplay/src/phone/java/com/google/android/accessibility/braille/brailledisplay/controller/CaptionConsumer.java
+++ b/braille/brailledisplay/src/phone/java/com/google/android/accessibility/braille/brailledisplay/controller/CaptionConsumer.java
@@ -20,7 +20,6 @@ import com.google.android.accessibility.braille.common.BrailleUserPreferences;
 import com.google.android.accessibility.utils.AccessibilityEventUtils;
 import com.google.android.accessibility.utils.AccessibilityNodeInfoUtils;
